<title>LATVIA: Latvia T-bill auction result shows mixed results.</title>
<headline>Latvia T-bill auction result shows mixed results.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yields on Latvian Treasury bills were mixed at auction on Wednesday with yields on two maturities rising and two falling, the finance ministry said.</p>
<p>Amounts are in millions of lats unless otherwise stated.</p>
<p> MATURITY    AV YLD    (LAST WEEK)   ISSUE   BID   SOLD</p>
<p> 28-day	 9.78	   9.64	 1.0    1.1    0.9</p>
<p> 91-day	10.10	  10.40	 1.40   2.14   1.40</p>
<p> Six-month   12.01	  11.95	 2.75   3.28   2.75</p>
<p> One-year    12.90	  12.96	 1.35   3.04   1.35</p>
<p>-- Riga Newsroom +371 7 22 66 93</p>
</text>
